OL,3,GNEWSAHow will Swinney 'rewire' local
OL,4,Agovernment and public services?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney's plans to overhaul the
OL,7,Fdelivery of public services do not end
OL,8,Fwith the NHS.
OL,10,FAs well as cutting the number of health
OL,11,Fboards, he wants to cut the number of
OL,12,Fother public bodies.
OL,14,FHe has specifically talked about
OL,15,Fcreating a single environment agency by
OL,16,Fmerging NatureScot, the Scottish
OL,17,FEnvironment Protection Agency and
OL,18,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
